  (global_label "NBIAS" (shape input) (at 299.59 302.079 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "35b34f0a-3502-411b-a4d7-9ecc589ab5c8"))
  (text "Bias supply: silicon diode off an AC tap, 1 k/4.7 k dropping through the choke, 27 k bleeder, dual 25/50 uF can -> -54 V." (at 219.59 317.889 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.15 1.15)) (justify left)) (uuid "53a16464-463c-4f5b-9cbe-121f3bb37055"))
  (text "drawn as a DC-neutral shunt at the tail, matching the corpus's other long-tailed-pair designs." (at 12.7 384.667 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "38da665b-934f-48dc-a0b2-2fc7d1607239"))
  (text "Power — universal power transformer (TR1, 125P7A), centre-tapped HT winding; two 3-diode series legs form a silicon full-wave bridge (no rectifier tube); 20 uF/600V filters either side of the choke (TR2, 125C1A); 4.7 k/1 W and 27 k/1 W droppers feed the driver and preamp taps." (at 12.7 389.067 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "a2ce5d6a-08ac-4f0a-8eaf-7e8482611f65"))
  (text "Two full channels (Bass, Normal), each two preamp stages with its own Bass/Treble/Volume tone network, mixing at a shared driver bottle ahead of a long-tailed-pair phase inverter and a fixed-bias 5881 pair off a solid-state bridge — no rectifier tube." (at 12.7 393.467 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "8aa73c04-f37c-46d2-95be-e5173d23d608"))
  (text "The Bass channel's own Treble control sits inside the driver bottle's signal path (V3A -> VR6 -> V3B), not beside its Bass/Volume pots. Heaters, PT primary, ground switch, fuse and standby switch omitted." (at 12.7 397.867 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.2 1.2)) (justify left)) (uuid "a4fd15b8-fa07-41a0-8bc0-e68df1e0f8ce"))
